      "body": "Gentle ping on this one — it's been open a couple of weeks with CI green (28 checks passing, no conflicts).\n\nThe fix is narrow: `deepscaler`'s reward path was grading the whole model output rather than the final `###Response` segment, so a rollout that reasoned its way to the right answer but restated an earlier wrong one could still score as correct. Happy to rebase, split it up, or address any concerns if the shape isn't what you'd want.",
